      "problem": "Simplify the expression $2\\cdot |-2s|+3.$",
      "worked_solution": "Firstly, since $|-a|=|a|,$ we can write our expression as\n\n$$\n2\\cdot |2s|+3.\n$$\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the multiplication, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot |2s|+3 & = \\\\ 2\\cdot |2|\\cdot |s|+3 & = \\\\ 2\\cdot 2\\cdot |s|+3 & = \\\\ 4|s|+3 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
